---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { Container } from "design-system-base";
---

<Layout
  title="Affiliate Disclosure — Metabolic 40+"
  description="Our full affiliate disclosure policy. Learn how Metabolic 40+ maintains editorial independence while earning commissions through affiliate partnerships."
  type="website"
  jsonLd={{
    '@context': 'https://schema.org',
    '@type': 'WebPage',
    name: 'Affiliate Disclosure',
    description: 'Full disclosure of affiliate partnerships and editorial policy at Metabolic 40+.',
  }}
>
  <Container class="py-12 sm:py-16">
    <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4">
        Affiliate Disclosure
      </h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mb-10">
        Last updated: {new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-US', { year: 'numeric', month: 'long', day: 'numeric' })}
      </p>

      <section class="mb-10">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4 pb-2 border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700">In Plain English</h2>
        <p class="text-body text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
          Metabolic 40+ is a free resource for adults over 40 who want to optimize their health, metabolism, and energy. To keep the site running and the content free, some of the links on this site are <strong>affiliate links</strong>. This means if you click a product link and make a purchase, we may earn a small commission — at <strong>no extra cost to you</strong>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-10">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4 pb-2 border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700">Our Editorial Standards</h2>
        <p class="text-body text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Affiliate partnerships <strong>never</strong> influence the content of our articles, the products we recommend, or the way we describe ingredients and benefits. Every recommendation goes through the same evidence-based review process:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-body text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
          <li>Ingredients and dosages are checked against peer-reviewed research</li>
          <li>Manufacturing quality and third-party testing are verified</li>
          <li>Customer reviews and complaints are analyzed for patterns</li>
          <li>Money-back guarantees and return policies are confirmed</li>
          <li>Pricing is compared against alternative products in the category</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-10">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4 pb-2 border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700">FTC Compliance</h2>
        <p class="text-body text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
          In accordance with the Federal Trade Commission's (FTC) Endorsement Guides (16 CFR Part 255), Metabolic 40+ clearly discloses affiliate relationships on every page that contains affiliate links. We use the <code class="px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-800 text-sm">rel="sponsored nofollow"</code> attribute on affiliate links and include visible disclosure notices on relevant articles.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-10">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4 pb-2 border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700">Questions?</h2>
        <p class="text-body text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
          If you have any questions about our affiliate relationships or editorial policy, please don't hesitate to reach out. Transparency is a core value of this site.
        </p>
      </section>
    </article>
  </Container>
</Layout>
